Usage: goodfetch-collie needs-you list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --after <AFTER>  The `next` of the page read before: the list goes on after it
      --kinds <KINDS>  Only the items of these kinds; every kind when absent
      --json           Prints the result as JSON
      --attached       Runs the call on an Attached engine in this process, even when a Daemon runs
      --daemon         Runs the call on the Daemon of the major, starting it if none runs; its refusal ends the command
      --color <WHEN>   When to colour human output; `auto` colours on a terminal unless `NO_COLOR` is set and not empty [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help           Print help

