  new-page  Opens a page in the Session, with its cookies and storage, and its own settings. Once the Session is closed, it raises `closed`
  close     Closes the Session: its pages and its browser context close, and its pages' admissions go back to the Resource governor; a Borrowed browser is never closed. A later call on the Session or one of its pages raises `closed`, and closing it again changes nothing
